flowchart TD
  UI[Scoped Origination IT: saved Applicant phone] --> Confirm[Save if editable, then confirm]
  Confirm --> Admit[Authorize and lock application + subject]
  Admit --> Cache{Exact conclusive pair under 30 days?}
  Cache -->|Yes| Receipt[Application-local audited receipt]
  Cache -->|No| Running{Existing in-flight check?}
  Running -->|Yes| Receipt
  Running -->|No| Attempt[Reserve one durable attempt]
  Attempt --> OAuth[OAuth outside transaction]
  OAuth --> Cap[Reauthorize + atomic Nairobi-day allowance]
  Cap --> Daraja[One TLS verification call]
  Daraja --> Evidence[Fenced independent evidence]
  Evidence --> Receipt
  Receipt --> Status[Read-only status; no signing resume]
